		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event5_enemy_1">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>バルバラ『かかわるだけ　ムダですわ
こういう　たぐいの　とのがたは▽
ほうっておくに　かぎりますわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T02:43:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T02:43:48" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>バルバラ『関わるだけ　ムダですわ
こういう類の　殿方は▽
放っておくに　限りますわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T07:08:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T07:08:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event5_hero_2">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『あっ　そんなあ
ちょっと……　かまって　くださいよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T02:24:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T02:24:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『あっ　そんなあ
ちょっと……　構って　くださいよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T07:08:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T07:08:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event5_enemy_2">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ドーブル『ブルブー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T08:07:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T08:07:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ドーブル『ブルブー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T08:07:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
